  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“We mwana wa muntu, sesema ku mpili sha mu Israeli kabili sosa auti, ‘Owe mwe mpili sha mu Israeli umfweni amashiwi yakwa Yawe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ‘Abalwani bakwa Israeli balacankwa abati, “Eeya. Shilya mpili shakale nomba cuma cesu.” ’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nomba sesema kabili utile, ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ‘Ilyo abantu ba mishobo ya mumbali bapokele no kutapa impili sha mu Israeli, bonse balewela Israeli no kumulandila ifibi pamo no musaalula.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi nomba umfweni ishiwi lya Mfumu Yawe. ‘Ine ne Mfumu Yawe ndemweba imwe mwe mpili, na imwe mwe tupili, na imwe mwe mikonko, na imwe mwe mawanga, nemwe mwe ncende ishashala amatololo, na mwe misumba iyashala ifibolya, mwebo abantu ba mishobo ya mumbali yaonawile no kulawela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine ne Mfumu Yawe ninkalipila nganshi abantu ba mishobo iyaba mumbali, palibufi Edomu ena eo ncishishepo. Abantu kulwa cilumba cabo ne misuula yabo balipoka icalo candi, ne ncende ishakucemenamo shalisanguka ishabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Kanshi niwe sesemena icalo ca Israeli amashiwi yandi, impili no tupili, imikonko na mashika, fyebe amashiwi yandi ayo ine ne Mfumu Yawe ndelanda cipyu cipyu kulwa bufuba, pantu filatukwa na bantu ba mishobo ya benafyalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine ne Mfumu Yawe nasumbula ukuboko kwandi no kulapa ukuti bakasebana abantu ba mishobo iyaba mumbali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Mu mpili sha mu Israeli mwena mukalamena imiti nakabili, no kulatwalamo ifitwalo ifyakuti mukalelya imwe mwe bantu bandi abena Israeli, pantu mwalaswa mubwelele bwangu bwangu kumyenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine ndi nenu, nalimusakamana kabili nkamukwatila uluse ndefwaisha ukuti mukalelima umushili wenu, no kulabyalamo imbuto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine nkamufusha mwe ba ŋanda yakwa Israeli bonse, mukaba abengi. Mukalaikala mu misumba, no kulabuukulula ifibolya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine nkafusha abantu, nkafusha ne fitekwa fine. Mukafulilako ukucila ifyo mwali kale, kabinge mukalakwata na bana abengi. Nkaleka mukaleikalamo ngefyo mwaleikalamo kale, kabili nkaleka mukashuuke ifyo mushatalile amushuuka kale. Lyena elyo mukashininkisha ukuti kanshi ine nine Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe mwe mpili, ala ine nkabweseshamo abantu bandi abena Israeli kuno kuli imwe, pakuti bakalenyanta pa mushili wenu. Mukaba icuma cabo icacishilano, tamwakatale nakabili amwipaya abana babo iyoo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ‘Pantu abantu basosa ukuti imwe mwe mpili mulalya abantu, nokuti imwe mulepaya abana ba mushobo wenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nomba ukufuma pali lelo imwe tamwakulalya abantu, nangu ukwipaila umushobo wenu abana.’ Ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ine nshilefwaya ukuti nakabili mukaleumfwa uko abantu ba mishobo balemutuka no kumuwela. Tamwakatale amusuulwa ku mishobo imbi nakalya, nangu kupunwisha umushobo wenu. Efyasosa Imfumu Yawe.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakabili ishiwi lyakwa Yawe lyaishile kuli ine aliti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“We mwana wa muntu, pa nshita aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli baleikala mu calo cabo, awe balicikowesha ku mikalile yabo na ku micitile yabo. Kuli ine, imyendele yabo yali iyabunani kwati mwanakashi uuli kumpepo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine napongolwele icipyu candi pali bena, pantu balisumyamo umulopa mu calo, no kucikowesha pa mulandu wakupepa utulubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalibapeele umulandu palwa mikalile yabo na palwa micitile yabo, no kubasalanganya nalibasalanganishishe mu fyalo fya mishobo ya benafyalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kabili konsefye uko baya, nako kwine tabancindika iyoo, pantu abantu balabalandapo abati, ‘Aba bantu mulemona bantu bakwa Yawe, lelo ebalya bantu abo atamfya mu calo ico abapeele.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ici cintu ine calilenga ukuti nsakamane palwa lulumbi lwandi, pantu aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli balindetele insoni pakati ka mishobo yonse uko baile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kanshi nomba iwe Esekieli, eba aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli aya mashiwi ayo ine ne Mfumu Yawe ndebeba nati, ‘Ifyo ine nalaswa ncite, te pa mulandu wa imwe iyoo, ine mpamfiwe palwa lulumbi lwandi, pantu imwe mwalindetela insoni ku mishobo yonse uko mwasalanganine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga nalanga abantu ba mishobo ya benafyalo ifyo ine naba Uwamushilo, nangula imwe mwandetele insoni kuli bena, lyena bakashininkisha ukuti kanshi ine nine Yawe,’ efyasosa Imfumu Yawe. Kabili imwe nimwe nkaleka mukeshibishe imishobo ya benafyalo ukuti ine ndi Wamushilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu ine nkamufumya ku mishobo ya benafyalo, na mu fyalo fimbi fyonse, no kumubwesesha mu calo cenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine nkamukana amenshi ayasuma kabili mukasanguluka. Ndi nokumusangulula ku fyakukowesha fyonse na ku tulubi tonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.11.19+EZK.11.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 11:19-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine nkamupeela umutima uupya kabili nkabikamo umupashi uupya muli imwe. Nkafumyamo umutima wa libwe muli imwe no kumupeela umutima wa munofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili nkabika muli imwe Umupashi wandi, no kumulenga ukukonka ifipope fyandi no kuposa amano kukusunga amafunde yandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukalaikala mu calo ico ine napeele ifikolwe fyenu. Mukaba abantu abandifye, na ine nkaba Lesa uwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkalamupususha ku fyamukowesha fyonse. Nkalenga ne ŋanu ukulafulisha, epakuti nakabili mwikalaponenwa ne cipowe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkalaleka imiti yenu ikaletwalisha ifitwalo, no kulafusha ifisabo mu mabala yenu, epakuti mwikalaponenwa nakabili icipowe icakumuletela insoni ku bantu ba mishobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mukalaibukisha imyendele yenu iyibi iyakale, ne micitile yenu iyakale, elyo nomba na mwe bene mukaleipata pa mulandu wa fyabubifi fyenu ne fyabunani fyenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ‘Ndefwaya mwishibe bwino ukuti ine nshilecita ifi fintu fyonse pa mulandu wenu iyoo. Ine ndefwayafye muleumfwa insoni, pantu mulaisebanya pa fintu ifyo imwe mucita. Efyasosa Imfumu Yawe.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabili ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ‘Pa bushiku nkamusangulula ku fyabubifi fyenu, elyo nkamuleka mukaleikala mu misumba yenu nakabili, no kumuleka mukakuule cipya cipya ifibolya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonsefye abapita mu mabala yenu, balamona ifyo yasapilwa, nomba ine nkaleka mukalelimamo nakabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bonse bakalalanda abati, “Tambeni icalo icali kale amatololo, moneni nomba ifyo cili kwati libala lya Edeni. Ne misumba iyabongolweke kale no kutapwa, no kushala ifibolya, moneni nomba ifyo baikuulile cipya cipya, no kukuulililako amalinga, nefyo abantu nomba baleikalamo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abantu ba mishobo iyaba mumbali abakashalapo, bakashininkisha ukuti nine ne Yawe nkuulile cipya cipya iyi misumba iyaonaike, no kubukulula amabala ayaonaike. Nine ne Yawe nalanda, no kucita efyo ine nkacita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Kabili ine ne Mfumu Yawe ndesosa ukuti, nakabili nkaleka aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli bakalemfwaya, pakuti ndebafwako. Nkaleka abantu babo bakafulishe nge mpaanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bakafulisha nge mikuni yakutuula ilambo pa bushiku bwa nshikunkulu ubwasontwa. Efyo imisumba iyaonaike ikesulamo amabumba ya bantu. Elyo abantu bakashininkisha ukuti kanshi ine nine Yawe.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
